### StrategyRuleService ve MarketDataService Entegrasyon Testi

### 1. MarketDataService Health Check
GET http://localhost:5275/api/test/health

### 2. MarketDataService Hisse Senedi Verisi Testi
GET http://localhost:5275/api/test/quote/THYAD

### 3. MarketDataService WebSocket Testi
GET http://localhost:5275/api/test/websocket/THYAD

### 4. StrategyRuleService Health Check
GET http://localhost:5184/api/test/health

### 5. StrategyRuleService MarketData Entegrasyon Testi (Detaylı)
GET http://localhost:5184/api/test/market-data/THYAD

### 6. StrategyRuleService Basit Strateji Testi
POST http://localhost:5184/api/strategy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "strategyName": "THYAD Test Stratejisi",
  "description": "THYAD için test stratejisi",
  "userId": 1,
  "stockSymbol": "THYAD",
  "transactionAmount": 10000,
  "buyThresholdPercent": -3.0,
  "profitTargetPercent": 3.0,
  "stopLossPercent": 2.0
}

### 7. StrategyRuleService Gelişmiş Strateji Testi
