Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockSymbol": "THYAD",
  "transactionAmount": 15000
}

### 8. Tüm Stratejileri Listele
GET http://localhost:5184/api/test/strategies

### 9. MarketDataService Finnhub API Testi (Direkt)
